flowchart TD
  SVC[Payments / orders services] -- outbox --> EV{{Event stream}}
  EV --> FAN[Fan-out<br/>match subscriptions per event type]
  FAN --> DQ[(Delivery jobs<br/>per-endpoint queues)]
  DQ --> W[Delivery workers<br/>sign · SSRF-safe egress · timeout 10 s]
  W -- 2xx --> OK[(Delivery log)]
  W -- error / timeout --> RS[Retry scheduler<br/>backoff + jitter, ~3 days]
  RS --> DQ
  RS -- exhausted --> DLQ[(Failed deliveries<br/>dashboard · replay)]
  W --> CB[Per-endpoint health<br/>circuit breaker · auto-disable]
